{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:0.4", "PA_ja_176:1.1"], "en": "6. The Kaḷāyamuṭṭhi Jātaka “Foolish indeed is this one who ranges among the branches of trees;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:1.2"], "en": "O Lord of Men, wisdom is not found in him.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:1.3"], "en": "“Having scattered an entire handful of peas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:1.4"], "en": "he searches for the one pea that has fallen.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:2.1"], "en": "“In just this way, O King, we— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:2.2"], "en": "And those others who are excessively greedy—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:2.3"], "en": "let us win much with little,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:2.4"], "en": "like a monkey with a mere pea.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_176:3.1"], "en": "The Kaḷāyamuṭṭhi Jātaka, the sixth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
